# Local agent-run artifacts: the reviewer writes per-game output (meta.json,
# summary.fa/en.json) under its DATA_DIR. On the VM this is a Docker volume;
# a local run drops it into the repo — never commit it. `.data/` (unanchored)
# matches that dir at any depth, including the nested agents/reviewer/agents/…
# path a relative local DATA_DIR produces.
.data/

.tmp
